@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### ================= restaurants =================

### 1 - paged list (Page<Restaurant>: items, total 4, limit 20, offset 0)
GET {{host}}/restaurants

### 2 - filter by area (2 records)
GET {{host}}/restaurants?area=Bole

### 3 - only open ones (3 records)
GET {{host}}/restaurants?isOpen=true

### 4 - only closed ones (1 record)
GET {{host}}/restaurants?isOpen=false

### 5 - paging: 2 items, total still 4
GET {{host}}/restaurants?limit=2

### 6 - the other two
GET {{host}}/restaurants?limit=2&offset=2

### 7 - limit over the cap (400)
GET {{host}}/restaurants?limit=999

### 8 - area not allowed (400)
GET {{host}}/restaurants?area=Adama

### 9 - static route above :id
GET {{host}}/restaurants/open

### 10 - one restaurant, bare object
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1

### 11 - the dishes of restaurant 1 (Page<Dish>)
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1/dishes

### 12 - restaurant that does not exist: 404, NOT an empty page
GET {{host}}/restaurants/99/dishes

### 13 - one dish of restaurant 1
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1/dishes/1

### 14 - dish 3 belongs to restaurant 2, so this pair is wrong (404)
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1/dishes/3

### ================= dishes =================

### list (Page<Dish>, total 8)
GET {{host}}/dishes

### filtered by restaurant
GET {{host}}/dishes?restaurantId=1

### sorted by price
GET {{host}}/dishes?sort=priceSantim&limit=3

### create (201)
POST {{host}}/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gomen", "priceSantim": 15000, "restaurantId": 2 }

### restaurant that does not exist (400)
POST {{host}}/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost Dish", "priceSantim": 15000, "restaurantId": 99 }

### ================= orders: the twelve calls =================

### 1 - paged list (Page<Order>, total 14)
GET {{host}}/orders

### 2 - limit=5 returns five
GET {{host}}/orders?limit=5

### 3 - page two: different five (ids 6 to 10)
GET {{host}}/orders?limit=5&offset=5

### 4 - filter by status (total 4)
GET {{host}}/orders?status=PENDING

### 5 - two filters together (Bole + DELIVERED: total 3)
GET {{host}}/orders?area=Bole&status=DELIVERED

### 6 - limit over the cap (400)
GET {{host}}/orders?limit=999

### 7 - static route above :id (only PENDING, total 4)
GET {{host}}/orders/pending

### 8 - the orders of restaurant 1 (total 4)
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1/orders

### 9 - restaurant that does not exist (404, not [])
GET {{host}}/restaurants/99/orders

### 10 - change the status (200, status is now PREPARING)
PATCH {{host}}/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PREPARING" }

### 11 - a status that is not in the union (400)
PATCH {{host}}/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "FLYING" }

### 12 - delete (204, empty body)
DELETE {{host}}/orders/6

### 12b - delete it again (404)
DELETE {{host}}/orders/6

### one order, bare object
GET {{host}}/orders/5

### create (201) - needs a restaurantId that exists
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "Sara Girma", "area": "Bole", "restaurantId": 1, "totalSantim": 24000 }
